e08836f8989d0f0af6bf24cb, https://si.imgix.net/9a10a2c7/uploads/origins/5455c719-5d79-4046-87b8-f6e566950f1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fdba245c00cf57f3d1ec72d65775bd6e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a10a2c7/uploads/origins/5455c719-5d79-4046-87b8-f6e566950f1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b2c30f947b9d735b1fd615dcf276fa01 3x"}, "body": "島そだちさんの素敵なイラストが大好きで、いつも楽しみにしております！\n\n今回描いていただきたいのは、太宰治の著書『駆け込み訴え』に登場するユダという人物です。（『駆け込み訴え』は2026年現在著作権保護期間が終了している作品です。参考:文化庁公式サイトURL→https://www.bunka.go.jp/seisaku/chosakuken/hokaisei/kantaiheiyo_chosakuken/1411890.html）\n\n島そだちさんの解釈やキャラデザが好きなので、見た目の解釈やポーズやシチュエーション、場面などはおまかせでお願いしたいです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@chain_of_islands/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3476927, "client_id": 2545754, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e771020fb6159fddce62099ef0f59479", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e771020fb6159fddce62099ef0f59479, https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e14df275fd469a9d218967816d9181aa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1efa2cd02553ae004464eddf77e06159 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ab5f1515d241d572ff071b4d2465467", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ab5f1515d241d572ff071b4d2465467, https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9ecd4d47c47fb5bc089a1c77a8042bfe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/761e7b41/uploads/origins/d2ae1c69-d2c6-410d-a13c-8021c5539ded?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf6adfc3e56b469659cf80f182c43d79 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのアートスタイルが大好きです。\n\nビショップ (193 cm)\nビショップは、親友の死を目の当たりにした過去に取り憑かれた貴族。過去から立ち直ろうとするものの、悲しみに打ちひしがれ、欠点だらけの男であるにもかかわらず、完璧さを表現するために新たな人格を作り上げる。ビショップはメランコリックでありながら破壊的なオーラを漂わせている。その沈痛な表情とは裏腹に、周囲に心配をかけないように笑顔を見せようとする。  彼は思いやりがあり、大切な人を大切にしすぎるほど大切にしており、困っている人にはよく手を貸している。  \n\n目の中の黄色、目の下の袋、右目の下のほくろにご注目！\n\n自由に着せて自由に描いてください！金額の調整が必要な場合はご返送ください！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14Jy-Unm5mh-Oei7ESXqATpZXIGkOdtXM?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@chain_of_islands/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3476927, "client_id": 3015400, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4147aa498f3d641fab8f9a98cbb7144", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4147aa498f3d641fab8f9a98cbb7144, https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81035aa47afde181fcbc6f117b55b8ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dd1ab287e1b235616e9ec63471aea44 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fcae6cdbef110bbdbf2517a803aebc1e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fcae6cdbef110bbdbf2517a803aebc1e, https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b912ed7476c2d975b602825a98905c6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04c95980/uploads/origins/9363e2bd-036d-4041-80a0-2bb100103fdf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fe3d76a9bc04536f03aa77d5975c2bc1 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art style and would like to request a drawing of my character.\n\nQuin (32):\n- A former villain who wants to repent, because he fears punishment from God, but doesn't know how.\n- His theme is a snake that is trying to shed its own skin, but gets stuck. Like an incomplete rebirth.\n- He's sarcastic, apathetic, and curt. He prefers to watch the world passively.\n- He works at an organization that fights supernatural creatures. He is a paramedic.\n- He has the power to destroy anything he touches, but his own body breaks down when he uses this ability. He lives in a lot of physical pain, believing he deserves it.\n- He burns photographs of his past.\n\nMotifs: decay, atrophy, regret, penance, burned photographs, scissors, and ouroboros.\n\nThank you for considering my request! ٩(｡•́‿•̀｡)۶\t\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GqEaeurgmSPtar6TksJmF82P7nuf_j3q?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@chain_of_islands/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3476927, "client_id": 1116701, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e77d0b46967dfa554f36118ad2d9b7c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e77d0b46967dfa554f36118ad2d9b7c, https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3b03dfdb6b910fea78fb9330d032079 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a39a98a37eb9335aeb4a4166b0bb185 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=82f7317351490a282e5ca3ca8bd63940", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=82f7317351490a282e5ca3ca8bd63940, https://si.imgix.net/6957e3f2/uploads/origins/8506ff78-926d-41bc-9209-089126a07b3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=21e5f80b596ddf36ddefa517fb